{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_title", "source_sha256": "33f2da10db513a7fd096624252dc9ae741d5b000e8fa79679fdbd793cdef686c", "ja": "お菓子作りはKAWAII！", "zh": "做点心超KAWAII！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d32d95aaa1a97174c0dba937f64329b83982d5d1a0ab6d16f32c51d4efef36c2", "ja": "カワイイ曲を歌うメンバーになれてウキウキ\nの真。仲間をサポートしようとクッキーを\n焼くが失敗し、隠そうとしたところを春香に\n気づかれてしまう。その後、琴葉も加わり、\n夢カワクッキー作りにリベンジする。", "zh": "成为演唱可爱歌曲的成员而兴奋不已\n的真。她想要支持伙伴们，于是烤了曲奇，\n却失败了，正想藏起来时被春香发现了。\n之后琴叶也加入进来，挑战制作梦幻可爱的曲奇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1000_null", "source_sha256": "18cb13fd16ce53511b4fa7c311aa86a7145f3036dba4ed87193e6255f20240ba", "ja": "―キックオフミーティング直後―", "zh": "—启动会议之后—", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "7d407e3f5f1fbd141aeacd137eb23fe227a74f567e5d82b6b6980b35921260b9", "ja": "へへっ、やーりぃ！　今度の新曲、\nバリバリキュートなアイドル全開曲だったな～！", "zh": "嘿嘿，太棒啦！这次的新歌，\n是首超级可爱、充分展现偶像魅力的歌曲呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "f504337e5970486eab2c73e8dc1080b027640500ff458ebd2948ff65730a24db", "ja": "あんな曲のメンバーに選ばれるってことは、\nボク、KAWAIIパワーがメキメキ育ってるんだ！", "zh": "会被选入那种曲子的成员名单，\n说明我的KAWAII力量正在突飞猛进呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "89cc143a89d1c19e1d018647a1a6d50388dd120587723a3e85f9965d79c3f21a", "ja": "腹筋だったら割れてきてる頃って感じかな♪　しかも\nボクがサブリーダー！　KAWAIIサブリーダー！", "zh": "腹肌的话，感觉差不多也该练出来了吧♪ 而且我还是副队长！可爱的副队长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "77fca1a42963bf812d3e2e6e14f78ff52e00c07f85acae85ea0a39de78a545cf", "ja": "この急成長KAWAIIパワーで、みんなをバシッと\nサポートしようっと！　まずは……あ、そうだ！", "zh": "就用这股飞速成长的可爱力量，干脆利落地支持大家吧！首先……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1005_null", "source_sha256": "21a4186f27c704f9581bbf157d7b05fa5f8f0bd08353e9879c1854f81f89bce8", "ja": "―レッスン初日―", "zh": "——练习第一天——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "cb94b21977582bcdc022c3f057311e192ffc45de49bb17ec51c0fadea6227e09", "ja": "あ、真！\n今日は早いね。おはよう♪", "zh": "啊，真！\n今天来得真早呢。早上好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "ff30b4538d9c8adf621edff8e980c410c11d0520b9399e0a39d4b72a4042f61e", "ja": "春香、おはよう！\nあの～、じつはボク……今日その、クッキーを…。", "zh": "春香，早上好！\n那个～，其实我……今天呢，那个，饼干……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "bf83bd251f4bae565e4c2ac70494e325f4326bb316a8d66585bef6673633ec55", "ja": "今日はカップケーキ焼いてきたんだ～。みんなで\n食べようと思って！　かわいくできたんだよ～、ほら♪", "zh": "今天我烤了纸杯蛋糕～想着和大家一起吃！做得很可爱哦～你看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "156152345767409e8710fcefe4b25d25427a6539f500d2fd589356814827ee77", "ja": "えっ、カップケーキ！？　うわぁ、いろんな色の\nクリームがかかってて……夢カワだ～っ！", "zh": "诶，纸杯蛋糕！？哇啊，上面裱着各种颜色的奶油……梦幻可爱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "277067c980ca70e5f45621ad8594f53d575fb5429d785f5955402daee46697cf", "ja": "？　真、いまクッキーって……。\nもしかして、真もクッキー焼いてきてくれたの？", "zh": "咦？真，你刚才说的是曲奇……。难道说，你也烤了曲奇带来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "7351d681fbadd6b6d54e0e212d36ee5fe331322e620a4610ed7e49dffdf41340", "ja": "あ、いや、その……聞き間違いじゃないかな？\nう、ウッキー、サルの挨拶！　なんちゃって。", "zh": "啊，不，那个……你是不是听错了？  \n呜、呜叽，这是猴子的问候！开玩笑的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "307e2175eb5357e66724d463e737d72a68b4aab94fc1e8ae67100b4339cad751", "ja": "絶対クッキーだよね？　いい匂いするもん！\nいいよ、カップケーキと一緒に食べよう？", "zh": "肯定是曲奇吧？因为闻起来好香！好呀，要不要和纸杯蛋糕一起吃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "f0c687be92be3d052449366a57b36de58038757aafb01962fdf2d53a37ff1f7f", "ja": "で、でも……。じつは、うまくできなかったんだよね。\n形も不揃いで、すぐ崩れちゃうし……。", "zh": "可、可是……其实做得不太好。\n形状也不一样，而且一碰就散……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "0e7e09aa000ebbf8b414bc7456a4180fbcf4b95d1bbf24db62a65b2445209c35", "ja": "あれを春香の夢カワカップケーキと並べるのは、\nなんていうか……恥ずかしくて……。", "zh": "要把那个和春香的梦幻可爱纸杯蛋糕摆在一起，总觉得……有点不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "48201f66ceb2ea478867471188170ac98c3268896cd7abcaebcac4a7554f56c1", "ja": "そんな……！　真が焼いてきてくれたってだけで、\n私はうれしいし、みんなすごく喜ぶと思うけど……。", "zh": "怎么会……！光是真亲手烤来给我的，我就已经很开心了，而且我觉得大家也一定会特别高兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "86d162b9b5bea502bd4594edc31e045d9538ffbc0948ef11fc1faa735a8e3d31", "ja": "あ。それじゃあ今度、一緒にクッキー焼かない？\nちょっとの工夫ですごくかわいくなるの！", "zh": "啊。那下次要不要一起烤曲奇？\n只要稍微花点心思，就会变得特别可爱哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "77717d3663337ce640e29d7fda43d46cba85f5beb133b0b7d3457acb690e9310", "ja": "春香……！", "zh": "春香……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "a633ea60513d6ccb16f74ef9b27d529b6d915d225a323dfeadf20a4129b9359e", "ja": "話は聞かせてもらいました。\n真ちゃん、私も協力させて。", "zh": "事情我都听说了。真，我也来帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "c8a6a0d11aba9ce8149ed65725470e748dcf3fcf8e04099a3710b90323db3903", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん！？", "zh": "琴叶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "805e3bb3f6ec4a0157e6a2d4e8cc4fff67d73d584e698645d36d40b12c041fe1", "ja": "みんなのために何かしたいって気持ち、とっても\n素敵だと思う。私もリーダーとして協力したいの。", "zh": "想为大家做点什么的心情，真的很\n棒。我也想作为队长出一份力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "8e8ae1c95acd729ae81793ed383dfc41d0fc380a282e6ff6ae246b7eb731caa3", "ja": "うう……二人とも、ありがとう～！", "zh": "呜呜……你们两位，谢谢啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1022_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "53c8b795d36fdb2210e0e0640d467a4d2f1055edaa526cdb5205ef6b1e0ff6ce", "ja": "まさか、キッチンスタジオ予約してくれるなんて。\nさすが琴葉ちゃんだね♪", "zh": "真没想到，你居然帮我们预约了共享厨房。\n真不愧是琴叶呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "10b7b24bd583d15dcb2a6349c09a36b8b8d4ace9267c1699e8a9f4d02911b56a", "ja": "うわぁ、すごい設備！　ピカピカだ～！\nここでならボクでも夢カワクッキーが焼けるかも♪", "zh": "哇，好厉害的设备！闪闪发亮的～！\n在这里的话，感觉我也能烤出梦幻可爱的曲奇呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "7b37235db3793e827c6c0d0774e3ee695e535ab96629f71a86256cb060b08906", "ja": "喜んでもらえてよかった。\n今日はここでカワイイお菓子作り、頑張ろう！", "zh": "你能喜欢真是太好了。\n今天就在这里努力做出可爱的点心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "faf43c1c2e0d56013cc74e906a3819503c9dad09e0f4069f1da08bd2e0d8bba2", "ja": "そうそう！　そうやってアイシングでレースみたいに\n縁取りしたら……ほら！　カワイくなったでしょ？", "zh": "对对！就像这样，用糖霜勾勒出蕾丝般的边缘……看！变得很可爱了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "7ac0872ad39cee14428628e882a0525d7c989f0cf75603c56540aac1fb5c27a9", "ja": "わぁ～本当だ！\nすごいよ、春香！", "zh": "哇～真的耶！\n好厉害啊，春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1028_001har", "source_sha256": "00c0e2ce77796a1f6849a688bea82e8e36d1ee57ee2435e29c1ea8dc92526842", "ja": "すごいのは真だよ♪\n私は横でおしゃべりしてただけ。", "zh": "厉害的是小真哦♪  \n我只是在旁边聊天而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "42cde898b12a55ef72cfcfcd3913b8ca4d91910fe447eb80a96bc18c8159b260", "ja": "同じクッキーでも、アイシングで絵を描いたりすると、\n見違えるほどかわいくなるんだ……！", "zh": "哪怕是同样的饼干，只要用糖霜画上图案，\n就会变得判若两人般可爱呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "f9a4481c07b3104fd9c072c4f29b9594c0bb2d1e09d7472c3d03b90951b609da", "ja": "「かわいい」って、もしかしたら……\n誰かに喜んでほしいっていうことなのかも。", "zh": "所谓“可爱”，说不定……\n就是想要让某个人开心起来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_006mak_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "2ed06b5c37699b36870c3b59c33c7d86ff4d9f1c046f952ddb71cc571e8f56c4", "ja": "ふたりとも、ありがとう！　これからもみんなで、\nKAWAIIパワーをバリバリ磨いていこうね！", "zh": "两位，谢谢你们！今后大家也一起，\n继续努力打磨可爱力量吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
